{"type": "say", "text": "Good afternoon, everyone. As you know, the battery-charging room was closed after the smoke alarm sounded during the afternoon charging cycle, and the visible smoke has since cleared. We need this room back for the next production shift's battery charging, so I'd like to begin our pre-reopening check now. Before I make my decision on whether we can reopen and under what conditions, I need to hear from each of you. Facilities — what's the status of the alarm system and ventilation in that room? Production supervision — what's our timeline and what's the charging schedule looking like for the next shift? Environmental compliance — do we have any concerns about air quality or potential contamination in the room? Let's go through this systematically so we can make a safe, informed decision."}
```

